Findings:

- **Check that cannot fail / own marker:** line 245, with input object `{"title":"x","question":"q","inputs":{"trials":[{"nct":"NCT00000000"}]},"results":{"by_outcome":{"primary":{"pooled":{"point":1.23,"ci_low":1.0,"ci_high":1.5}}}}}` passed through `page(...)`. Consequence: a source object with a live pooled estimate is still rendered with the hardcoded line-191 “No pooled estimate” marker, so the check passes while suppressing the estimate.

- **Selector keyed to wrong form:** line 248, with input object `{"title":"x","question":"see NCT00000000","inputs":{"trials":[]},"results":{}}`. Consequence: the page has zero trial rows, but the regex sees the NCT-like text in the question and accepts “names a trial.”

- **Selector keyed to wrong form / vacuous link check:** line 250, with exact HTML input `<a href="MISSING.html" class="go">x</a>`. Consequence: the regex returns no href because it requires `class="go" href="..."` in that order, so a broken offered link is not checked.

- **Probe keyed to string removed by fix:** line 324, with exact key input `"pcsk9-inhibitors-cv-review"` against the `SURVIVORS` literal at lines 58-68. Consequence: `--selftest` raises `KeyError` instead of testing the withdrawn-estimate case.

No proven finding in this pasted file for CRLF text comparison, merged-cell/off-by-one tabulation, zero conflated with absent, negation dropped, or wrapper status-code reporting. COULD NOT DETERMINE worktree-vs-HEAD/origin/served-copy defects without the caller/deploy context.
